ted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/8ee4f391bac9b8064e4e3c4b0ee4dba5.poster.avif?t=1770463406\" width=544 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/8ee4f391bac9b8064e4e3c4b0ee4dba5.webm?t=1770463406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/8ee4f391bac9b8064e4e3c4b0ee4dba5.mp4?t=1770463406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the lighthouse with valuable loot to become stronger! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/5677d018ee94bc6cc792406921f16693.poster.avif?t=1770463406\" width=544 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/5677d018ee94bc6cc792406921f16693.webm?t=1770463406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/5677d018ee94bc6cc792406921f16693.mp4?t=1770463406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New events will be waiting for you every day. Have pirates landed on the island? Have you decided to become a gladiator to earn money? Did a merchant ship crash? Make your own destiny!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/d0dca23c65f2eee7f3783bee005608b5.poster.avif?t=1770463406\" width=544 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/d0dca23c65f2eee7f3783bee005608b5.webm?t=1770463406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"h